1
00:00:01,348 --> 00:00:02,429
獸醫剛來電話
The vet called.

2
00:00:02,957 --> 00:00:04,847
斯黛拉的體檢結果出來了
Stella's test results came back.

3
00:00:04,847 --> 00:00:07,767
他想讓我把她帶回去... 今天
He wants me to bring her in...today.

4
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:10,177
不 過來抱一下
Oh, no. Come here, you.

5
00:00:10,177 --> 00:00:11,997
杰 我很遺憾
Oh, Jay, I'm so sorry.

6
00:00:11,997 --> 00:00:15,717
但這就是喜歡寵物的壞處 對吧
That is the bad thing about loving animals, right?

7
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:19,616
但是想想你帶給她了多少美好的事情
But think about all the wonderful things you gave her,

8
00:00:19,616 --> 00:00:22,956
像是美麗的家 美味的食物...
like a beautiful home, delicious food...

9
00:00:23,156 --> 00:00:24,826
...還有我們的婚床
...our marital bed.

10
00:00:24,936 --> 00:00:29,656
節哀順變 我們會將她銘記于心的
I'm sorry, Jay. Stella will not be forgotten.

11
00:00:30,836 --> 00:00:32,986
我不是要帶她去安樂死 你個女巫
I'm not putting her down, you goblin.

12
00:00:32,986 --> 00:00:34,475
她需要做手術
She needs a surgery.

13
00:00:34,475 --> 00:00:37,245
那真是個好消息
Oh. That is such great news.

14
00:00:37,565 --> 00:00:38,815
斯黛拉怎么了
Oh, what's wrong with Stella?

15
00:00:38,815 --> 00:00:41,035
她患有軟腭過長癥
She has an elongated soft palate,

16
00:00:41,035 --> 00:00:43,065
所以有時候會難以呼吸
which is why sometimes it's hard for her to breathe.

17
00:00:43,065 --> 00:00:44,585
并且睡覺打呼嚕
And she snores a lot.

18
00:00:44,585 --> 00:00:46,335
那他們能給你也做這手術嗎
Any chance that they can do you, too?

19
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:48,634
這是個嚴肅的手術 他們得對她進行全身麻醉
This is a serious operation. They have to put her out.

20
00:00:48,634 --> 00:00:50,324
如果她醒不過來怎么辦
What happens if she doesn't wake up?

21
00:00:50,324 --> 00:00:51,126
我要怎么辦
What would I do?!

22
00:00:51,126 --> 00:00:52,654
我去拔智齒的時候
When I got my wisdom teeth out,

23
00:00:52,654 --> 00:00:54,864
你為了在十點半的截止時間前買到雞蛋麥芬
you made me walk the last four blocks to the dentist

24
00:00:54,864 --> 00:00:57,354
讓我走了最后的四個街區去到牙醫那里
so you could get an Egg McMuffin before the 10:30 cut-off.

25
00:00:57,354 --> 00:00:58,824
你得把這事兒忘了
You're gonna have to let that go.

26
00:00:59,104 --> 00:01:00,354
你知道嗎 我不會做的
You know what? I'm not gonna do it.

27
00:01:00,354 --> 00:01:02,014
-她看起來很好 -也許她只是需要
- She seems fine. - Maybe she just needs

28
00:01:02,014 --> 00:01:03,613
一些新鮮空氣來保證呼吸順暢
some fresh air to breathe better.

29
00:01:03,613 --> 00:01:05,353
我們何不帶她去狗狗公園呢
Why don't we take her to the dog park?

30
00:01:05,353 --> 00:01:07,973
這是個好主意 不過外面可能有點泥濘
That's a great idea. Might be a little muddy out there.

31
00:01:08,263 --> 00:01:10,073
我去拿你的靴子 美女
I'm gonna get your boots, gorgeous.

32
00:01:10,083 --> 00:01:11,353
謝謝你
Thank you.

33
00:01:11,553 --> 00:01:14,543
我的靴子在壁櫥里 就在...
My boots are in the closet, next to the --

34
00:01:15,043 --> 00:01:16,863
他剛才是在對斯黛拉說話嗎
Was he just talking to Stella?

35
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:17,974
過來抱一下
Come here, you.

36
00:01:31,082 --> 00:01:33,951
皇冠造型護墻板 皇冠造型護墻板
Crown molding wainscoting, crown molding wainscoting,

37
00:01:33,951 --> 00:01:36,521
法式門信用評分 法式門信用評分
French door credit score, French door credit score.

38
00:01:36,521 --> 00:01:37,831
在為重要的房屋展示做熱身嗎
You warming up for a big showing?

39
00:01:37,831 --> 00:01:38,681
非常重大
Very big.

40
00:01:38,681 --> 00:01:40,641
我終于給胡嬌找到了他的夢之屋
I finally found Pepper his dream house.

41
00:01:40,641 --> 00:01:41,531
我不敢相信你還在
I can't believe you're still

42
00:01:41,531 --> 00:01:42,721
為那個男人浪費時間
letting that man waste your time.

43
00:01:42,721 --> 00:01:44,661
你都給他看了多少房子了
How many houses have you shown him?

44
00:01:44,861 --> 00:01:47,841
就只有... 我不知道 120棟嗎
Only, like -- I don't know, like, uh, 120.

45
00:01:47,841 --> 00:01:49,410
但我們玩得很開心 他很有意思
But we have fun. He's a hoot.

46
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:51,940
親愛的 就連米奇和小卡都同意
Honey, even Mitch and Cam agree that he's impossible,

47
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:53,550
他不可能也不會買一棟房子
and he's never gonna buy a house.

48
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:54,500
-他會的 -不會的
- Yes, he will. - No.

49
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,510
他總能雞蛋里挑骨頭
He always manages to find something wrong.

50
00:01:56,510 --> 00:02:00,570
上一棟房子 瑜伽間離安全室太近了
The last house, the yoga room was too close to the panic room.

51
00:02:00,570 --> 00:02:02,000
他本來是愿意接受的
He was willing to live with that,

52
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,669
但那塊地不適合他養的獵鷹
but the property wasn't zoned for his falcons.

53
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:07,389
不過今天的這棟 符合他期望清單的每一條
This one today, though, checks every single box.

54
00:02:07,389 --> 00:02:11,049
很好 那么如果胡嬌今天沒買下房子
Great. So if Pepper doesn't buy the house today,

55
00:02:11,049 --> 00:02:13,409
你得答應別讓他再纏著你了
you agree to stop letting him string you along

56
00:02:13,409 --> 00:02:15,159
你得放棄他這個客戶
and drop him as a client.

57
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:18,919
咱倆達成交易之前 你纏了我多久
How long did you string me along before I closed that deal?

58
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:21,068
親愛的 你沒法讓胡嬌懷孕
Honey, you can't get Pepper pregnant

59
00:02:21,068 --> 00:02:23,038
-并且把他困在一個房子里 -我們走著瞧
- and trap him in a house. - You're on.

60
00:02:23,058 --> 00:02:24,128
你記得要在五點到家吧
You remember you need to be home

61
00:02:24,128 --> 00:02:25,309
-對吧 -記得
- at five, right? - Yeah.

62
00:02:26,168 --> 00:02:27,159
等等 為什么
Wait, why?

63
00:02:27,328 --> 00:02:29,398
艾麗克斯的男朋友 比爾 搞了一些發明
Alex's boyfriend, Bill, has cooked up some invention

64
00:02:29,398 --> 00:02:31,118
想讓我們投資
he wants us to invest in.

65
00:02:31,198 --> 00:02:32,339
為什么是我們呢
Why us?

66
00:02:32,728 --> 00:02:36,367
因為有人給了他鼓舞了他
Because someone inspired him.

67
00:02:36,617 --> 00:02:38,697
你們可以看到 我正在審查中的專利
As you can see, my patent-pending

68
00:02:38,697 --> 00:02:42,327
穿戴式椅子 穿戴不會有累贅感
Wear-Chair TM, barely noticeable.

69
00:02:42,407 --> 00:02:44,237
-我喜歡 -不管何時我站累了
- I love it. - Whenever I get tired of standing,

70
00:02:44,237 --> 00:02:47,167
我只需要 按下這個按鈕
all I have to do -- press this button.

71
00:02:47,707 --> 00:02:51,556
一條彈簧腿就會噴射出來 提供舒適的座位
A spring-loaded leg jets out to provide me with a comfy seat.

72
00:02:53,366 --> 00:02:54,966
你把它穿反了 是嗎
You put it on backwards, didn't you?

73
00:02:54,966 --> 00:02:56,387
我想說的是 比爾
My point is, Bill,

74
00:02:56,576 --> 00:02:58,686
我們每個人內心都有一項偉大的發明
there's a great invention inside all of us.

75
00:02:58,686 --> 00:03:00,446
拜托了 準時到家就行
Please, just be home in time.

76
00:03:00,536 --> 00:03:02,226
我可不想獨自打破一個男人的夢想
I don't want to crush a man's dreams on my own.

77
00:03:02,226 --> 00:03:03,256
你得跟我一起
You have to do it with me.

78
00:03:03,256 --> 00:03:05,595
誰知道呢 也許我們會喜歡他的發明
Who knows? We might love his invention.

79
00:03:05,595 --> 00:03:06,685
肯定會很傻的
It's gonna be stupid.

80
00:03:06,685 --> 00:03:08,125
幸好你沒和喬治·福爾曼結婚
Good thing you weren't married to George Foreman

81
00:03:08,125 --> 00:03:10,805
否則我們現在還是一次只能烤一面肉
or we'd still be grilling our meats one side at a time.

82
00:03:12,705 --> 00:03:15,841
莉莉 你 你今天怎么樣啊
So, Lily, how -- how are you today?!

83
00:03:15,841 --> 00:03:17,282
莉莉
Lily?!

84
00:03:17,282 --> 00:03:18,926
莉莉
Lily.

85
00:03:19,375 --> 00:03:21,134
你爸爸剛才問你今天過得如何
Your father was just asking how you're doing.

86
00:03:21,134 --> 00:03:22,484
你還好嗎
Are -- Are you all right?

87
00:03:22,574 --> 00:03:24,284
-我很好 -好的
- I'm fine. - Okay.

88
00:03:25,754 --> 00:03:26,535
好
Yeah.

89
00:03:27,654 --> 00:03:29,684
我剛才給你打手勢
Okay, uh... I gestured you over here

90
00:03:29,684 --> 00:03:30,994
是因為我們得討論一下莉莉的事
'cause we need to talk about Lily.

91
00:03:30,994 --> 00:03:32,114
我推理出來了
Yes, I puzzled that out.

92
00:03:32,114 --> 00:03:34,384
而且 你也不需要小聲說話 看著
Also, you don't need to whisper. Watch.

93
00:03:34,384 --> 00:03:35,933
親愛的 你爸爸和我可能要離婚了
Honey, your father and I may get divorced

94
00:03:35,933 --> 00:03:37,973
因為他正考慮變性成個女人
because he's thinking about becoming a woman.

95
00:03:37,973 --> 00:03:39,663
這解釋了很多事情
That explains a lot.

96
00:03:39,843 --> 00:03:43,053
-我在兩首歌的間隙 -夠了 出來 這邊
- I'm in between songs. - Okay, all right. Now out. This way.

97
00:03:43,553 --> 00:03:44,723
她到底怎么了
What is going on with her?

98
00:03:44,723 --> 00:03:46,973
我不想再被關在她心門外了
I don't want to be shut out like this another day.

99
00:03:46,973 --> 00:03:49,183
我知道 但我們 我們先別驚慌失措吧
I know, but let's -- let's not get hysterical.

100
00:03:49,183 --> 00:03:50,412
我才沒有驚慌失措
I'm not getting hysterical.

101
00:03:50,412 --> 00:03:51,852
-你也就能再撐幾分鐘 -的確
- We're minutes away. - Fair enough.

102
00:03:51,852 --> 00:03:53,522
我只是想看她笑
I just want to see her smile.

103
00:03:53,522 --> 00:03:55,382
好的 我要給羅納多再發個短信
Yeah, okay, I'm gonna text Ronaldo again.

104
00:03:55,382 --> 00:03:58,362
希望他能讓我們參加吉米的愛派對
Hopefully he got us into that KimmyLoveandStuff party.

105
00:03:58,362 --> 00:04:00,712
吉米的愛是一個莉莉喜歡的
KimmyLoveandStuff is an Internet sensation

106
00:04:00,712 --> 00:04:02,012
-網絡紅人 -沒錯
- that Lily loves. - Yeah.

107
00:04:02,012 --> 00:04:03,912
她試穿衣服
She tries on clothes,

108
00:04:04,032 --> 00:04:06,211
她哭訴霸凌和塑料
she cries about bullies and plastic.

109
00:04:06,211 --> 00:04:08,041
大伙兒 想象一下
You guys, just imagine

110
00:04:08,041 --> 00:04:10,661
你是一只海龜 這事兒發生在你身上
if you were a turtle and this happened to you.

111
00:04:10,661 --> 00:04:12,671
我們全家都為她著迷
Our whole family is obsessed with her.

112
00:04:12,671 --> 00:04:14,991
這就是一個少女
And that's the great thing about a tween girl

113
00:04:14,991 --> 00:04:16,261
有兩個同志爸爸的好處
having two gay dads.

114
00:04:16,261 --> 00:04:18,191
我是說 我們 我們愛好一致
I mean, we -- we love the same things.

115
00:04:18,191 --> 00:04:20,331
小鮮肉 時尚 八卦
Cute guys, fashion, gossip.

116
00:04:20,331 --> 00:04:22,690
我的天哪 羅納多 他把我們弄進去了
Oh, my God! Ronaldo, he got us in!

117
00:04:22,690 --> 00:04:23,406
了不起
Amazing.

118
00:04:23,427 --> 00:04:24,900
我們得給他一個感謝禮物
Okay, we have to get him a thank-you gift.

119
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,690
不 不 他欠你的 好嗎
No, no, he owes you, okay?

120
00:04:26,690 --> 00:04:28,190
你給了他你的骨髓
You gave him your bone marrow.

121
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:29,570
我怎能不給呢
Well, how could I not?

122
00:04:29,570 --> 00:04:32,100
他沒吃飽 我又一點都吃不下了
He was still hungry, and I wasn't gonna eat any more of it.

123
00:04:32,990 --> 00:04:36,539
然后我們回到正式的入口
And we make our way back to the formal entryway,

124
00:04:36,539 --> 00:04:38,549
根據你的期望清單
which, according to your checklist,

125
00:04:38,549 --> 00:04:40,749
"要大到當人們進入的時候
"Must be large enough to make people swoon

126
00:04:40,749 --> 00:04:42,139
就會為此傾倒"
when they step inside."

127
00:04:42,139 --> 00:04:43,529
我想再來一遍
I want to do it again.

128
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:47,109
那個胡嬌自稱很有錢
Ugh, that Pepper claims to be wealthy,

129
00:04:47,109 --> 00:04:48,759
我才不信...
but I don't believe it for a --

130
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,689
我的天哪
Oh, my heavens!

131
00:04:49,689 --> 00:04:50,968
我們就是鄉巴佬
We're peasants.

132
00:04:50,989 --> 00:04:53,028
這里的一切都符合你的期望...
It's got everything on your list --

133
00:04:53,038 --> 00:04:55,588
鋼琴吧 他和他的餐廳
piano bar, his and his dining rooms,

134
00:04:55,588 --> 00:04:59,188
還要能看到蕾哈娜的屋頂 這點我一直沒懂
plus a view of Rihanna's roof, which I never quite understood.

135
00:04:59,188 --> 00:05:01,118
我給她辦過一次派對 我能感覺
I did a party for her once, and I could feel

136
00:05:01,118 --> 00:05:04,578
那雙巴貝多人的眼睛用看不上的眼神俯視了我
those judgy Barbadian eyes looking down on me.

137
00:05:04,648 --> 00:05:08,247
現在誰在俯視著誰呢 日日
Now who's looking down on who, RiRi?

138
00:05:08,247 --> 00:05:11,357
常言道 地點 地點 復仇
Like they say, location, location, vengeance.

139
00:05:11,847 --> 00:05:13,267
你真有意思
You're funny.

140
00:05:13,267 --> 00:05:15,897
這房子太好了 菲爾 媽媽會喜歡的
Oh, it's fabulous, Phil. Mother would love it.

141
00:05:15,897 --> 00:05:18,557
正是她的慷慨和我的委托
It's her generosity and my power of attorney

142
00:05:18,557 --> 00:05:20,337
才讓購買這座房子成為可能
that are making this purchase possible.

143
00:05:20,337 --> 00:05:23,356
所以 我們準備好簽報價單了嗎
So...are we ready to sign the offer?

144
00:05:23,616 --> 00:05:24,727
就快了
Very close.

145
00:05:24,876 --> 00:05:26,476
我還想在里面住一小會兒
I just want to live in it for a bit,

146
00:05:26,476 --> 00:05:28,026
體驗一下日常生活的感覺
get a feel for the everyday.

147
00:05:28,026 --> 00:05:29,206
你不著急 對吧
You're in no hurry, right?

148
00:05:29,206 --> 00:05:30,626
不不不 要是我著急
Oh, no, no, no. If I was in a hurry,

149
00:05:30,626 --> 00:05:32,946
怎么會帶你看了兩百多座房呢
would I have shown you over 200 houses?

150
00:05:33,326 --> 00:05:35,276
我等不及要去公園了
I can't wait to get to the park.

151
00:05:35,386 --> 00:05:36,655
那是我們的郵遞員
Hey, there's our mailman.

152
00:05:38,155 --> 00:05:39,275
冷靜點 杰
Settle down, Jay.

153
00:05:39,275 --> 00:05:40,645
天 我今天好癢
Boy, I'm itchy today.

154
00:05:40,645 --> 00:05:42,485
我希望那只叫賓果的狗在公園
Hey, I hope that dog Bingo's at the park.

155
00:05:42,485 --> 00:05:44,035
和他玩很有意思
He's fun to play with.

156
00:05:44,105 --> 00:05:45,865
你在干什么 你錯過那個轉彎了
What are you doing? You just missed our turn.

157
00:05:45,865 --> 00:05:47,295
我只是從另一條路走
I'm just going another way.

158
00:05:47,295 --> 00:05:48,516
沒有別的路了
There is no other way.

159
00:05:49,715 --> 00:05:51,435
你不是要帶我們去公園
You're not taking us to the park.

160
00:05:52,194 --> 00:05:53,314
我們要去看獸醫
We're going to the vet.

161
00:05:53,314 --> 00:05:55,794
醫生說了她需要做手術
The doctor said that she needs this surgery.

162
00:05:55,794 --> 00:05:56,804
她會沒事的
She's gonna be fine.

163
00:05:56,804 --> 00:05:58,624
我不舒服 我要透透氣
I feel sick. I need some air.

164
00:06:02,154 --> 00:06:04,804
這里是我在新房子的普通的一天
So, here I am on an ordinary day in my new house

165
00:06:04,804 --> 00:06:09,263
大家都嫉妒我 而我昂首闊步 洋洋得意
everyone hates me for and I'm walking and I'm kvelling...

166
00:06:09,263 --> 00:06:13,403
我們氣喘吁吁 大汗淋漓
And we're panting and we're schvitzing...

167
00:06:13,413 --> 00:06:17,643
我們笑 我們哭
And we're laughing and we're crying...

168
00:06:17,643 --> 00:06:19,133
我們陷入思考
And we're thinking.

169
00:06:19,133 --> 00:06:20,673
我在擊球
And I'm putting.

170
00:06:20,673 --> 00:06:22,063
所以你的車里
So, you have an entire wardrobe

171
00:06:22,063 --> 00:06:23,542
有一整個衣柜嗎
in your car?

172
00:06:23,542 --> 00:06:27,302
? 我在演奏 我在歌唱 ?
♪ And I'm playing and I'm singing ♪

173
00:06:27,302 --> 00:06:29,432
? 大家都愛死了 ?
♪ And they're loving it ♪

174
00:06:30,162 --> 00:06:32,512
我說愛死了
I said loving it.

175
00:06:35,032 --> 00:06:36,673
這簡直是場災難
This is a disaster!

176
00:06:36,712 --> 00:06:38,291
真是"閃亮登場"啊
What a fun way to enter a room.

177
00:06:38,291 --> 00:06:40,301
我知道今天比爾要來和你們聊聊
I know Bill's coming over to talk to you guys today,

178
00:06:40,301 --> 00:06:42,421
-我要崩潰了 -寶貝 不用擔心
- and I'm freaking out. - Oh, honey, don't worry.

179
00:06:42,421 --> 00:06:43,871
我們不會投資他的發明的
We're not gonna invest in his invention.

180
00:06:43,871 --> 00:06:45,441
那不是他想和你們談話的原因
That's not why he wants to talk to you.

181
00:06:45,441 --> 00:06:46,631
那是個幌子
It's a cover.

182
00:06:46,631 --> 00:06:49,051
他要征求你們的祝愿娶我
He's going to ask for your blessing to marry me.

183
00:06:49,051 --> 00:06:51,421
-什么 -你們不能同意
- Whoa, what? - And you have to tell him no.

184
00:06:51,421 --> 00:06:52,650
你怎么知道的
How do you know this?

185
00:06:52,650 --> 00:06:54,980
他們家所有男人都在情人節求婚
All of the men in his family propose on Valentine's Day,

186
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:56,170
情人節馬上就到了
which is coming up.

187
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:57,620
我看了他給剛訂婚的朋友
I read a text he sent to his buddy

188
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,320
發的短信 詢問一些關于
who just got engaged asking for tips

189
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,410
求婚順利的秘訣 而且我的朋友看見他
for a good proposal, and my friend saw him

190
00:07:01,410 --> 00:07:02,810
從一家珠寶店出來
coming out of a jewelry store.

191
00:07:02,810 --> 00:07:05,800
所以你翻他的短信還追蹤他的行蹤
So you read his texts and you track his movements.

192
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,639
這下我可知道他為什么這么想綁住你了
I can see why he's so eager to lock you down.

193
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:10,079
你看 我真的很喜歡和比爾在一起
Look, I really like being with Bill,

194
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:12,089
如果我不得不拒絕他
and if I have to turn him down,

195
00:07:12,089 --> 00:07:14,479
那我們的感情就完了
that means the end of the relationship

196
00:07:14,479 --> 00:07:17,309
美好的性愛也沒了
and all that great sex.

197
00:07:17,309 --> 00:07:19,469
你現在可真是釋放真我啊 是吧
Really come out of your shell, haven't you?

198
00:07:23,708 --> 00:07:27,358
好了 你準備好了嗎 驚喜
Okay. Are you ready?! Surprise!

199
00:07:27,608 --> 00:07:29,888
我還需要點提示信息
I'm gonna need a little bit more information.

200
00:07:29,888 --> 00:07:32,628
你現在在吉米的愛
You are at KimmyLoveandStuff's

201
00:07:32,628 --> 00:07:33,828
新化妝品系列的
exclusive launch party...

202
00:07:33,828 --> 00:07:37,318
獨家發布派對 她還要演唱
...for her new makeup line, and she's gonna sing

203
00:07:37,318 --> 00:07:38,477
-她的熱門單曲 -單曲
-her hit single... - Single!

204
00:07:38,477 --> 00:07:39,807
《給我愛》
..."Give Me Love and Stuff."

205
00:07:39,807 --> 00:07:42,397
好吧 你們是怎么做到的
Okay. How did you guys do this?

206
00:07:42,397 --> 00:07:45,877
你們好啊 陌生人 歡迎
Hello, total strangers. Welcome.

207
00:07:45,877 --> 00:07:47,327
非常感謝你做的一切 羅納多
Thank you so much for doing this, Ronaldo.

208
00:07:47,327 --> 00:07:48,677
要是有人問你們是誰
If anyone asks who you are,

209
00:07:48,677 --> 00:07:50,897
就說你們在找加斯·布魯克斯[鄉村歌手]的簽售
say you were looking for the Garth Brooks book signing.

210
00:07:50,897 --> 00:07:52,497
你們穿這么土他們會信的
They'll believe you because of your clothes.

211
00:07:52,497 --> 00:07:54,216
我要去找找洗手間
I'm gonna go look for the bathroom.

212
00:07:54,496 --> 00:07:57,246
-好吧 -看 她這么緊張 真是可愛
- Okay. - Oh, look, she is so nervous, it's adorable.

213
00:07:57,246 --> 00:07:59,326
你覺得有沒有辦法
Um, uh, do you think that there's any way

214
00:07:59,326 --> 00:08:01,966
讓吉米的愛和莉莉打個招呼
we can get KimmyLoveandStuff to come over and meet Lily?

215
00:08:01,966 --> 00:08:04,286
我不被允許看她的眼睛 所以不行
I'm not allowed to look her in the eye, so no.

216
00:08:04,696 --> 00:08:05,797
我是羅納多
This is Ronaldo.

217
00:08:06,406 --> 00:08:08,995
從地上撿起來 吹吹灰放回托盤里就好了
Just pick it up, blow on it, and put it back on the tray.

218
00:08:08,995 --> 00:08:10,855
這種問題還用問
Are you kidding me with these questions?

219
00:08:10,935 --> 00:08:12,245
我們得讓吉米的愛
We got to get KimmyLoveandStuff

220
00:08:12,245 --> 00:08:13,085
跟莉莉打個招呼
to say hi to Lily.

221
00:08:13,085 --> 00:08:15,755
她的狗波在那兒 她應該在附近
Well, there's her dog, Boo, so she's nearby.

222
00:08:15,755 --> 00:08:17,965
我想到一個簡單的好主意
Okay, I just got a really sketchy but great idea.

223
00:08:17,965 --> 00:08:19,715
你帶肉干了嗎
Um, did you pack your jerky?

224
00:08:20,465 --> 00:08:21,735
火雞 牛肉 還是三文魚
Turkey, beef, or salmon?

225
00:08:21,735 --> 00:08:23,005
-我們要這么干 -拜托
- Here's what we're gonna do. - Oh, please.

226
00:08:23,005 --> 00:08:24,794
這又不是我第一次用包包里的肉干
This is not the first time I've lured an animal

227
00:08:24,794 --> 00:08:26,844
把小動物從它主人身邊引開了
away from its owner with my purse jerky.

228
00:08:28,684 --> 00:08:31,464
波 過來 波 想吃點好吃的嗎
Boo, come here. Boo, you want some treats?

229
00:08:31,464 --> 00:08:32,825
好女孩 過來
Good girl. Come here.

230
00:08:33,344 --> 00:08:34,874
讓開 波
Move! Boo!

231
00:08:34,874 --> 00:08:36,600
有人看到波了嗎
Does anyone have eyes on Boo?!

232
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,524
那兩個老男人搶走她了
Those old men snatched her.

233
00:08:38,574 --> 00:08:40,143
你們是想偷走我的狗嗎
Are you trying to steal my dog?

234
00:08:40,143 --> 00:08:41,743
不不不 不好意思 我們只是想
No, no, no, no. I'm so sorry. We were just --

235
00:08:41,743 --> 00:08:43,013
我們只是想吸引你的注意
We're just trying to, uh, get your attention.

236
00:08:43,013 --> 00:08:44,613
是這樣的 我們的女兒 莉莉
Yeah, you see, our daughter, Lily, she --

237
00:08:44,613 --> 00:08:45,983
她是你的超級粉絲
she's a massive fan

238
00:08:45,983 --> 00:08:48,543
她現在有點沮喪 我們只是
and she's a little depressed right now and we just --

239
00:08:48,573 --> 00:08:49,943
我們想再次看到她的笑臉
we want to see her smile again.

240
00:08:49,943 --> 00:08:52,793
我的天
Oh...my...God.

241
00:08:54,232 --> 00:08:56,422
同志爸爸最好了
Gay dads are the best!

242
00:08:56,422 --> 00:08:58,222
-我們也是這么說的 -我們說的
- That's what we said. - We say that.

243
00:08:58,222 --> 00:08:59,832
我覺得因為我們喜歡找樂子
I think it's because we love to have fun,

244
00:08:59,832 --> 00:09:01,682
而且又不害怕面對現實
but we're also not afraid to get real.

245
00:09:01,682 --> 00:09:05,152
我不想看到你們的女兒不高興
Aww. I hate the idea of your daughter not smiling.

246
00:09:05,152 --> 00:09:06,372
讓我們給她帶來快樂吧
Let's go make her day.

247
00:09:06,372 --> 00:09:07,522
好 那邊的是她
Okay, well, that's her right there.

248
00:09:07,522 --> 00:09:09,141
那是莉莉
Um, that's Lily.

249
00:09:09,141 --> 00:09:10,121
拍下來
Film this.

250
00:09:10,121 --> 00:09:11,391
她在跟我說話嗎
I-Is she talking to me?

251
00:09:11,391 --> 00:09:12,061
是的
Yeah.

252
00:09:12,061 --> 00:09:13,841
當然 吉米的愛小姐
Of course, Ms. LoveandStuff.

253
00:09:15,341 --> 00:09:17,901
你們好 粉絲們 這里是你們的吉米
Hey, lovers and stuffers. It's your girl, Kimmy.

254
00:09:17,901 --> 00:09:19,391
我們現在在我的發布派對
We're here at my launch party

255
00:09:19,391 --> 00:09:22,881
我要去給我的頭號粉絲一個驚喜
where I'm about to surprise my biggest fan.

256
00:09:22,881 --> 00:09:25,360
你們準備好看某人的"吉"動反應了嗎
You ready to see someone's mind kim-plode?

257
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:31,270
你好 莉莉 你玩得開心又有愛嗎
Hey, Lily. You having fun and stuff?

258
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:32,390
你好
Hey.

259
00:09:32,390 --> 00:09:34,200
莉莉 這是吉米的愛
Lily, it's KimmyLoveandStuff.

260
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,330
我知道 我說了"你好"
I know. I said "Hey."

261
00:09:35,330 --> 00:09:36,640
你知道嗎 我覺得她是震驚得語無倫次
You know what? I think she's in shock.

262
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,510
莉莉 不如你給她講講你最喜歡的視頻
Lily, why don't you tell her your favorite video.

263
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:40,639
我的最愛是你講種族歧視
Mine was when you tackled racism

264
00:09:40,689 --> 00:09:42,359
然后給自己綁了個可愛的魚尾辮
and gave yourself that cute fishtail braid.

265
00:09:42,359 --> 00:09:43,529
是啊 該莉莉說了
Uh-huh. And Lily.

266
00:09:43,529 --> 00:09:46,019
我已經不看你的視頻了 抱歉 我們能走嗎
I don't watch them anymore. Sorry. Can we go?

267
00:09:46,019 --> 00:09:47,599
停 拿過來
Cut! Give me that!

268
00:09:47,599 --> 00:09:49,379
莉莉 你這樣很不禮貌
Lily? You're -- You're being very rude.

269
00:09:49,379 --> 00:09:50,759
超級不禮貌
Extra rude!

270
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:53,009
你們是誰 你們怎么進來的
And who are you people and how did you get in here?

271
00:09:53,009 --> 00:09:56,248
-加斯·布魯克斯 -等我查清楚你們就完了
- Garth Brooks. - When I find out, heads will roll.

272
00:09:56,678 --> 00:09:58,888
-感覺真是尷尬死人了 -你還尷尬 那我們呢
- I'm so embarrassed. - You're so embarrassed?

273
00:09:58,888 --> 00:10:00,129
你們還好意思尷尬
You're so embarrassed?

274
00:10:02,288 --> 00:10:03,838
好了 我們準備好給史黛拉做手術了
Okay. We're ready for Stella.

275
00:10:03,838 --> 00:10:05,358
我還沒準備好
Well, I'm not ready.

276
00:10:05,358 --> 00:10:06,659
杰 好了
Jay, come on.

277
00:10:07,318 --> 00:10:09,608
好吧 小心點
All right. Careful.

278
00:10:11,717 --> 00:10:13,487
等一下 我得和她說兩句話
Wait a second. I-I have to say something.

279
00:10:14,707 --> 00:10:17,267
小姑娘 我知道你很害怕
Little girl, I know you're scared.

280
00:10:17,267 --> 00:10:19,647
我也怕 但你是一個斗士
Me too. But you're a fighter.

281
00:10:19,647 --> 00:10:22,237
"別擔心 爸爸 我會沒事的"
"Don't worry, Daddy. I'll be fine."

282
00:10:22,237 --> 00:10:23,637
她的聲音不是這樣
She doesn't sound like that.

283
00:10:23,637 --> 00:10:25,816
抱歉 她會很好的
Sorry. She'll do great.

284
00:10:26,296 --> 00:10:29,236
你是怎么回事 我從沒見過你這樣
What is going on with you? I've never seen you like this.

285
00:10:29,236 --> 00:10:30,137
我不知道
I don't know.

286
00:10:31,446 --> 00:10:33,406
我十歲的時候 爸爸救了只狗帶回家
When I was 10, Dad came home with a rescue,

287
00:10:33,406 --> 00:10:35,136
我興奮得不行
and I was so damned excited.

288
00:10:35,626 --> 00:10:37,256
但那只狗根本不想理我
But the dog wanted nothing to do with me --

289
00:10:37,256 --> 00:10:39,946
直奔向我妹妹 永遠只跟著我打轉
went straight to my sister and never left her side.

290
00:10:40,575 --> 00:10:44,225
數年后 我們養的小狗也只粘著迪迪
Then years later, we got a puppy who went right to Dede,

291
00:10:44,225 --> 00:10:46,145
我一接近她就沖我咆哮
growled at me every time I went near her.

292
00:10:46,665 --> 00:10:50,065
但我什么努力都沒做 斯黛拉就選了我
But with Stella, I didn't even bother trying, and she chose me.

293
00:10:50,925 --> 00:10:52,535
而我或許再也見不到她了
Now I may never see her again.

294
00:10:53,815 --> 00:10:56,894
我坐不住 我得出去走走
I-I-I can't sit here. I need to take a walk.

295
00:10:59,084 --> 00:11:00,764
做哪種手術
What kind of surgery?

296
00:11:00,764 --> 00:11:02,764
不過是調整一下呼吸問題
They just have to fix her breathing.

297
00:11:02,764 --> 00:11:03,924
沒什么大不了的
It's not a big deal.

298
00:11:03,924 --> 00:11:05,884
他們是這么告訴你的嗎
Is that what they told you?

299
00:11:05,924 --> 00:11:07,894
我要是你就會更上心
I'd be careful if I were you.

300
00:11:07,894 --> 00:11:08,804
這話什么意思
What do you mean?

301
00:11:08,804 --> 00:11:11,683
男人對寵物的愛很瘋狂
Men get crazy about their animals.

302
00:11:11,733 --> 00:11:15,333
我丈夫以前有只丑貓 脖子上有個大瘤
My husband had this horrible cat with a big lump on its neck.

303
00:11:15,333 --> 00:11:18,043
是良性的 我丈夫不介意
It was benign, didn't bother my husband,

304
00:11:18,043 --> 00:11:19,873
但我一看到就鬧心
but I couldn't stand looking at it.

305
00:11:19,873 --> 00:11:21,903
于是某天 我丈夫上班后
So one day, when my husband was at work,

306
00:11:21,903 --> 00:11:24,963
我帶貓來這 讓他們把瘤切了
I brought the cat in here to have them take that thing off

307
00:11:24,963 --> 00:11:25,773
然后
and --

308
00:11:26,122 --> 00:11:28,392
它死在了手術臺上
It died right on the table.

309
00:11:28,392 --> 00:11:30,652
不 你丈夫發火了嗎
Ay, no. Was your husband mad?

310
00:11:30,652 --> 00:11:33,622
發火了 已經是前夫了
Ex-husband, so yeah.

311
00:11:34,252 --> 00:11:35,493
媽的
Damn it.

312
00:11:36,822 --> 00:11:37,903
你好
Hola.

313
00:11:38,712 --> 00:11:39,773
有人嗎
Hello?

314
00:11:42,531 --> 00:11:45,431
這下好了 我還以為下一個是我
Well, all righty. I thought I was next.

315
00:11:46,361 --> 00:11:49,681
我還是第一次在看房時慢烤肋排
Well, that's the first time I've slow-cooked ribs for a showing.

316
00:11:49,681 --> 00:11:50,771
是我媽的菜譜
Mother's recipe.

317
00:11:50,771 --> 00:11:53,471
你準備好出價了嗎
So, are you ready to make an offer?

318
00:11:55,431 --> 00:11:56,560
我說不好 菲爾
I don't know, Phil.

319
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,810
哪里說不好 阿嬌
Don't know what, Pep?

320
00:11:58,590 --> 00:12:00,220
我就是沒感覺
I'm just not feeling it.

321
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:02,080
或許我們該再看看別的房子
Maybe we should see some more houses?

322
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,441
沒問題
No problemo.

323
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,050
你想看其他社區的房子
Um, did you want to look in another neighborhood

324
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:07,426
還是想留在地獄里
or stay right here in Hell?!

325
00:12:07,426 --> 00:12:10,390
你說什么
I beg your --

326
00:12:10,390 --> 00:12:14,339
我說求求你 老天爺 買這房子吧
No, I beg. For God's sakes, buy this house.

327
00:12:14,339 --> 00:12:17,659
我整個職業生涯里從沒這么賣力過
I've worked harder for you than any client in my entire career.

328
00:12:17,739 --> 00:12:19,429
我不知道你是優柔寡斷
I don't know if you're indecisive,

329
00:12:19,429 --> 00:12:21,349
虐待狂 還是單純的精神病
sadistic, or just plain crazy.

330
00:12:21,349 --> 00:12:22,279
親愛的
Hey there, honey.

331
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:23,439
你還在看房 對不對
You're still there, aren't you?

332
00:12:23,439 --> 00:12:25,899
他差兩筆就簽好了
He's just dotting the I's, crossing the T's.

333
00:12:25,899 --> 00:12:28,488
還在耍你 別理他了
Yanking your chain. Dump him.

334
00:12:28,488 --> 00:12:29,908
比爾隨時會到
Listen, Bill's about to be here any minute,

335
00:12:29,908 --> 00:12:32,298
情況有變
and the situation has changed.

336
00:12:33,088 --> 00:12:34,109
我得掛了
Got to go.

337
00:12:35,708 --> 00:12:39,348
回來 我照你吩咐找到廁所有錦鯉池的房呢
Get back here! I found you a bathroom with a koi pond!

338
00:12:43,727 --> 00:12:45,637
斯黛拉在車上 上車
I have Stella! Get in!

339
00:12:49,527 --> 00:12:50,478
她在哪
Where is she?

340
00:12:50,627 --> 00:12:52,637
-在后面 -她還好嗎
- She's in the back. - Is she okay?

341
00:12:52,707 --> 00:12:55,017
我把她劫出來的 我不能逼你這么做
I busted her out. I can't make you do this.

342
00:12:55,017 --> 00:12:56,207
假如她有什么三長兩短
If something happens to her,

343
00:12:56,207 --> 00:12:57,676
你永遠不會原諒我
you're never going to forgive me,

344
00:12:57,676 --> 00:12:59,126
我不想像這樣失去你
and I don't want to lose you like that.

345
00:12:59,126 --> 00:13:01,596
真感人 但你沒在停車標志下停車
Well, that's touching, but you just blew through a stop sign.

346
00:13:01,596 --> 00:13:03,496
她在寵物醫院或許更安全些
She'd probably be safer at the vet.

347
00:13:05,266 --> 00:13:07,426
羅納多 是我 菲爾·鄧菲
Ronaldo. It's Phil Dunphy.

348
00:13:07,426 --> 00:13:08,447
你好 菲爾
Hello, Phil.

349
00:13:08,556 --> 00:13:10,506
我正在給天后備餐
I'm preparing a plate for a diva.

350
00:13:10,586 --> 00:13:11,686
一切還好嗎
Is everything okay?

351
00:13:11,686 --> 00:13:13,115
其實不太好
Uh, actually, no.

352
00:13:13,115 --> 00:13:14,435
我對胡嬌發脾氣了
I lost my temper with Pepper

353
00:13:14,435 --> 00:13:16,065
因為他告訴我還想再看別的房子
when he told me he wanted to see more houses,

354
00:13:16,065 --> 00:13:17,735
我一直在給他打電話想道歉 可是
and I've been calling to apologize, but...

355
00:13:17,735 --> 00:13:19,505
-他不接 -你怎么知道
- He's not picking up. - How did you know?

356
00:13:19,505 --> 00:13:22,225
下半句還有可能是別的嗎
It seemed the only possible conclusion to your sentence.

357
00:13:22,225 --> 00:13:23,595
菲爾 你知道為什么
Phil, do you know the reason

358
00:13:23,595 --> 00:13:25,305
我不再跟胡嬌一起看房子了嗎
I stopped house hunting with Pepper?

359
00:13:25,305 --> 00:13:27,404
是因為那次賣家以為胡嬌是你爺爺嗎
Was it when that seller thought Pepper was your grandpa?

360
00:13:27,404 --> 00:13:29,264
從那以后他就不準我涂防曬霜了
He hasn't let me wear sunscreen since.

361
00:13:29,424 --> 00:13:32,624
不 因為我終于意識到他是不會買房的
No. I finally realized he wasn't going to buy a house.

362
00:13:32,624 --> 00:13:35,164
你開玩笑嗎 我浪費了數百個小時
Are you kidding? I've wasted hundreds of hours.

363
00:13:35,164 --> 00:13:38,154
我疝氣手術都延期了 他為什么這樣對我
I postponed hernia surgery. Why would he do that to me?

364
00:13:38,154 --> 00:13:39,375
他喜歡你
He likes you.

365
00:13:39,774 --> 00:13:41,434
大多數直男都覺得胡嬌很煩人
Most straight guys find Pepper annoying,

366
00:13:41,434 --> 00:13:43,054
可你總對他那么友好
but you're always so nice with him.

367
00:13:43,313 --> 00:13:44,713
我想他是擔心假如買了房
I think he's afraid if he buys a house,

368
00:13:44,713 --> 00:13:46,893
-就再也見不到你了 -真的嗎
- he'll never see you again. - Really?

369
00:13:46,893 --> 00:13:49,013
一直這么憋著實在太痛苦了
Wow, it's so painful keeping everything inside.

370
00:13:49,013 --> 00:13:50,343
他就是這么長大的
It's how he was raised.

371
00:13:50,343 --> 00:13:51,593
不 是我的疝帶不管用了
No, my truss isn't working.

372
00:13:51,593 --> 00:13:52,953
我得趕快安排動手術
I've got to schedule that procedure.

373
00:13:52,953 --> 00:13:54,333
你知道胡嬌在哪嗎
Do you know where Pepper is?

374
00:13:54,333 --> 00:13:56,713
他每次難過都去一個特別的地方
He has a special place he goes when he's sad.

375
00:13:56,713 --> 00:13:59,652
挺基的 你看過《愛樂之城》嗎
It's pretty gay. Have you ever seen the movie "La La Land"?

376
00:13:59,652 --> 00:14:02,062
當然 等等 是不是能眺望城市的長椅
Of course. Wait, does he go to the bench overlooking the city

377
00:14:02,062 --> 00:14:03,162
就是瑞恩·高斯林和艾瑪·斯通
where Ryan Gosling and Emma Stone

378
00:14:03,162 --> 00:14:04,732
跳著踢踏舞愛上彼此的地方
tap danced into each other's hearts?

379
00:14:04,732 --> 00:14:06,822
-沒有很基啊 -好吧
- That's not so gay. - Okay.

380
00:14:07,742 --> 00:14:08,682
不不不不不
No, no, no, no, no, no.

381
00:14:08,682 --> 00:14:10,203
拜托你把耳機摘下來
Take those things off, please.

382
00:14:10,282 --> 00:14:13,421
我們現在得談談你到底是怎么回事
We need to talk about whatever's going on with you right now.

383
00:14:13,421 --> 00:14:15,601
-我沒事 -不 你有事
- I'm fine. - No, you're not fine.

384
00:14:15,601 --> 00:14:17,411
你悶悶不樂又冷漠疏遠
You're sullen and aloof and --

385
00:14:17,411 --> 00:14:19,671
你讓我們丟人 當著吉米...
and you embarrassed us in front of KimmyLoveandStu --

386
00:14:19,671 --> 00:14:20,981
我說不下去了
I can't say it again. I can't.

387
00:14:20,981 --> 00:14:24,071
我們給了你每個少女夢想中的一天
Okay, we gave you every tween girl's dream day,

388
00:14:24,071 --> 00:14:26,241
而你笑都沒笑一下
and-and you can barely crack a smile.

389
00:14:26,241 --> 00:14:28,850
這不是我夢想中的一天 是你們的
It's not my dream day. It's yours.

390
00:14:28,850 --> 00:14:31,250
我沒有你們這種少女心
I'm not the same kind of tween girl you guys are.

391
00:14:31,250 --> 00:14:33,280
可我們喜歡一樣的東西
But we love all the same things.

392
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:35,750
我變了 我不喜歡碧昂絲
I've changed. I don't like Beyonce.

393
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:36,850
你把這話收回去
You take that back!

394
00:14:36,850 --> 00:14:37,831
或小甜甜
Or Britney.

395
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:38,714
或嘎嘎
Or Gaga.

396
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:42,270
我只是因為你們喜歡而假裝喜歡
I only fake it 'cause you guys like that stuff.

397
00:14:42,270 --> 00:14:43,789
我和你們不一樣
I'm different.

398
00:14:43,789 --> 00:14:46,939
寶貝 這就是你低落的原因嗎
Well, honey, is it -- is that why you've been feeling so down,

399
00:14:46,939 --> 00:14:48,899
因為你覺得你和我們不一樣
because you-you feel different than us?

400
00:14:48,899 --> 00:14:51,779
不知道 我好像覺得和很多人都不一樣
I don't know. I guess I feel different than a lot of people.

401
00:14:51,779 --> 00:14:55,669
寶貝 這點你兩個爸太有共鳴了
Well, sweetie, that is one thing your dad and I can relate to.

402
00:14:55,669 --> 00:14:58,788
我想這才是有一對同志老爸最棒的地方
I guess, well, that's the great thing about having two gay dads.

403
00:14:58,788 --> 00:15:01,208
我們知道不合群是什么感覺
We-we know what it feels like to be an outsider.

404
00:15:01,208 --> 00:15:02,438
慢慢就好了
Okay, but here's what happens.

405
00:15:02,438 --> 00:15:05,488
你會找到像你一樣不合群的人
You start finding people who don't quite fit in,

406
00:15:05,488 --> 00:15:08,288
你們一起結伴不合群
and you start not fitting in together.

407
00:15:08,288 --> 00:15:09,308
我們永遠不想讓你覺得
We never want you to feel like

408
00:15:09,308 --> 00:15:11,308
你在我們面前得裝成其他人
you have to be someone else for us.

409
00:15:11,308 --> 00:15:12,909
-永遠 -說回來
- Never. - I mean --

410
00:15:12,918 --> 00:15:15,067
你總聽的是什么音樂
What is this music you're always listening to?

411
00:15:15,067 --> 00:15:16,247
-快 讓我們也聽聽 -是啊
- Come on. Let us in. - Yeah.

412
00:15:16,247 --> 00:15:18,007
好吧 我喜歡這種的
Okay. I like this.

413
00:15:18,007 --> 00:15:19,407
來 放來聽聽吧
Okay. Let's put it on, huh?

414
00:15:19,407 --> 00:15:20,488
好啦 準備好了
All right. Here we go.

415
00:15:20,617 --> 00:15:23,057
? 你的理智在哪里 ?
♪ Where's your sanity? ♪

416
00:15:23,077 --> 00:15:26,887
-有意思 -對啊
- Fun! - Yeah.

417
00:15:26,887 --> 00:15:28,276
是啊 真的 我喜歡
Yeah, yeah, I like it.

418
00:15:29,276 --> 00:15:30,797
她有一天一定會殺了我們
She's gonna kill us someday.

419
00:15:33,066 --> 00:15:35,216
我想跟說 我真的很感激
Hey. I just want to say, I really appreciate you

420
00:15:35,216 --> 00:15:37,136
你愿意費心救出斯黛拉
wanting to save Stella like that.

421
00:15:37,136 --> 00:15:39,326
斯黛拉并不是唯一主動選你的人
Well, Stella is not the only one that choose you.

422
00:15:39,326 --> 00:15:42,946
我也每天都選你 而且我比表面上更愛她
I choose you every day, and I love her more than I show.

423
00:15:43,935 --> 00:15:46,095
好啦 小寶貝 我放你進家里
Okay, sweetheart. Let's get you inside.

424
00:15:46,095 --> 00:15:48,415
我再給咱倆煎上牛排吃
I'll throw on a couple of steaks for both of us.

425
00:15:50,225 --> 00:15:51,495
這是什么亂七八糟的狗
What the hell dog is this?

426
00:15:51,505 --> 00:15:53,415
-是斯黛拉啊 -才不是
- It's Stella. - No, it's not.

427
00:15:53,415 --> 00:15:55,755
都八年了 你還認不出咱家的狗嗎
Eight years, you don't recognize our dog?

428
00:15:55,755 --> 00:15:58,674
都十年了 你還認不出我剪頭發了嗎
Well, 10 years, and you don't notice one haircut?

429
00:16:00,164 --> 00:16:03,184
等我們回到獸醫那里 手術已經結束
By the time we got through to the vet, the surgery was over.

430
00:16:03,184 --> 00:16:04,304
斯黛拉平安無恙
And Stella was fine.

431
00:16:04,304 --> 00:16:06,364
我得承認歌洛莉亞這次真的勞心勞力
I just have to say Gloria really stepped up

432
00:16:06,364 --> 00:16:08,164
協助我的寶貝身體康復
and nursed my baby back to health.

433
00:16:08,164 --> 00:16:09,554
除了一個問題
Only one problem.

434
00:16:10,414 --> 00:16:11,904
她現在選我了
Stella choose me now.

435
00:16:11,904 --> 00:16:14,043
她不是真心的 是因為你給她止痛藥
It's not real. You give her pain meds.

436
00:16:14,043 --> 00:16:16,193
她只是在當自己毒販的舔狗
It's like she's sucking up to her dealer.

437
00:16:17,343 --> 00:16:18,173
你好啊 比爾
Hi, Bill.

438
00:16:18,173 --> 00:16:19,313
-您好 -請進
- Hey. - Come on in.

439
00:16:19,313 --> 00:16:21,703
-謝謝 -鄧菲先生在家嗎
- Thanks. - Is, uh, Mr. Dunphy around, too?

440
00:16:21,703 --> 00:16:24,043
不在 但他應該在回家的路上了
Uh, no, he's probably on his way back,

441
00:16:24,043 --> 00:16:25,584
我們有事應該等他回來了再說
and we should definitely wait for him.

442
00:16:25,703 --> 00:16:27,453
可是我很快就得趕去上班了
Oh. I actually have to get to work pretty soon.

443
00:16:27,453 --> 00:16:29,032
或許你代表一下你們倆發表意見吧
Do you think maybe you could just speak for the both of you?

444
00:16:29,032 --> 00:16:32,032
不行 菲爾非常有主見
Nope. Phil is very opinionated.

445
00:16:32,032 --> 00:16:35,082
也非常嚴格 "一切以我說了算"
And strict. "What I say goes around here."

446
00:16:35,172 --> 00:16:37,302
他是個令人畏懼的顧客
He's a very scary customer.

447
00:16:37,512 --> 00:16:39,712
好吧 我真得沒得選了
Okay. I don't really have a choice here.

448
00:16:42,302 --> 00:16:44,221
鄧菲先生與太太
Mr. And Mrs. Dunphy...

449
00:16:44,511 --> 00:16:47,361
你們愿意給像我這樣的人一個機會
would you be willing to take a chance on a guy like me

450
00:16:47,361 --> 00:16:49,731
-然后讓我... -艾麗克斯現在結婚太早了
and let me -- Alex is too young to get married.

451
00:16:49,751 --> 00:16:52,051
抱歉了 菲爾他這人暴脾氣
I'm sorry. Phil, who is very quick to anger,

452
00:16:52,051 --> 00:16:53,132
絕對不會同意
would never allow it.

453
00:16:53,201 --> 00:16:55,451
我不是要來提親啊
Oh, I wasn't asking to marry Alex.

454
00:16:57,141 --> 00:16:58,702
這... 這是在干嘛
What -- What's happening?

455
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:00,800
然后更怪的事發生了
And then it got weirder.

456
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,520
女士們先生們
Ladies and gentlemen...

457
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:05,220
我向大家展示我的最新發明
...I give you my new invention,

458
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:08,560
專利的自我救贖鞋拉衣
the Pull-Yourself-Up-By-Your-Bootstraps™.

459
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,490
這種事情你碰過多少次了
How many times has this happened to you?

460
00:17:10,490 --> 00:17:12,050
你在床上睡覺
You're in bed, asleep.

461
00:17:12,050 --> 00:17:13,201
突然之間
All of a sudden...

462
00:17:13,990 --> 00:17:14,860
天啊 糟糕
Oh, no.

463
00:17:15,029 --> 00:17:17,409
地震了 沒時間穿好衣服
It's an earthquake. No time to get dressed.

464
00:17:17,409 --> 00:17:21,149
你只能再次光著身子立刻逃到大街上
I'm gonna have to run out into the street naked again.

465
00:17:21,149 --> 00:17:23,259
除非...
Huh. Unless...

466
00:17:28,939 --> 00:17:30,518
那我就能一秒逃出家門啦
And I'm out the door in seconds.

467
00:17:30,518 --> 00:17:32,358
-行啊 -就這樣嗎
- Oh, okay. - That's it?

468
00:17:32,358 --> 00:17:34,888
你不是來我家提親的嗎
You didn't come to ask for my hand in marriage?

469
00:17:34,888 --> 00:17:36,528
什... 當然不是啊
Wh-- Of course not.

470
00:17:36,528 --> 00:17:37,458
"當然不是" 你這話什么意思
What do you mean, "Of course not"?

471
00:17:37,458 --> 00:17:38,738
那我們交往干嘛 比爾
What are we doing, Bill?

472
00:17:38,738 --> 00:17:39,838
寶貝 別得了便宜還賣乖
Honey, take the win.

473
00:17:39,838 --> 00:17:41,299
冷靜 首先呢
Okay, first of all,

474
00:17:41,498 --> 00:17:43,778
你是個智慧超群又獨立自主的女性
you're a super smart, independent woman

475
00:17:43,778 --> 00:17:45,357
前方有大好的未來在等著你
with an amazing future ahead of you.

476
00:17:45,357 --> 00:17:46,517
你怎么會想現在結婚呢
Why would you want to get married right now?

477
00:17:46,517 --> 00:17:47,467
所以呢 那你說你昨天
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm. So, what were you doing

478
00:17:47,467 --> 00:17:48,848
去珠寶行里做什么
in that jewelry store yesterday?

479
00:17:48,907 --> 00:17:50,877
是去鐘表珠寶行里給手表換電池啊
I was getting a battery for my watch.

480
00:17:50,877 --> 00:17:51,577
你怎么會知道我去鐘表珠寶行啊
How did you know I was in a jewelry store?

481
00:17:51,577 --> 00:17:53,047
那你那條短信寫著...
And what about that text you s--

482
00:17:53,047 --> 00:17:54,137
無論如何
For what it's worth,

483
00:17:54,137 --> 00:17:57,087
如果我之前知道你有這意愿 我今天就求婚了
if that's what I thought you wanted, I would propose today.

484
00:17:57,287 --> 00:17:59,387
我挺確定你就是我一生的某某
Hmm. I'm pretty sure you're my forever someone.

485
00:17:59,867 --> 00:18:00,787
真的嗎
Really?

486
00:18:01,556 --> 00:18:02,826
亞歷桑德拉·鄧菲
Alexandra Dunphy...

487
00:18:04,506 --> 00:18:05,276
-你愿意... -媽
- would you... - Mom!

488
00:18:05,276 --> 00:18:07,306
好了 大家平身 行了
Okay, everybody up. All right.

489
00:18:07,426 --> 00:18:09,236
起來 很多事得處理 很多火得去滅呢
There we go. A lot of fires to put out.

490
00:18:09,466 --> 00:18:10,916
下一次再問 我會把這句話說完
Next time, I'll get to the end.

491
00:18:11,176 --> 00:18:12,766
下一次你問 我或許就準備好了
Next time, I might be ready.

492
00:18:13,316 --> 00:18:16,285
我真不喜歡解放版的艾麗克斯
Ugh. Not a fan of liberated Alex.

493
00:18:23,775 --> 00:18:24,856
美好的夜晚
Lovely night.

494
00:18:26,035 --> 00:18:27,545
你來這里做什么
What are you doing here?

495
00:18:27,545 --> 00:18:29,545
我打給你你愛人問你會上哪了
I called Ronaldo looking for you.

496
00:18:33,294 --> 00:18:37,564
每當發現我人生不像音樂劇美好時 我都來這
I come to this place when life turns out not to be a musical.

497
00:18:38,144 --> 00:18:39,384
而我常常來這里
I'm up here a lot.

498
00:18:39,384 --> 00:18:41,084
我吼了你 對不起
I'm sorry I yelled at you.

499
00:18:41,304 --> 00:18:43,034
菲爾 你也不是第一個
Well, Phil, you're not the first person

500
00:18:43,034 --> 00:18:44,724
覺得我討人厭了
to find me a tad trying.

501
00:18:45,074 --> 00:18:48,273
你聽了可能很驚訝 但其實我沒有多少朋友
This may shock you, but I don't have many friends.

502
00:18:51,603 --> 00:18:53,403
表達點驚訝吧 菲爾
Express some shock, Phil.

503
00:18:53,403 --> 00:18:54,984
但你有很多朋友啊
But you have tons of friends.

504
00:18:55,503 --> 00:18:56,913
米奇爾與小卡都愛你
Mitch and Cam love you.

505
00:18:57,283 --> 00:19:00,363
偶爾接觸的話他們還行
Yeah, they're okay in small doses.

506
00:19:00,882 --> 00:19:02,792
但直男朋友就從不這樣了
And a straight-guy friend, never.

507
00:19:03,172 --> 00:19:05,252
很多直男們覺得我...
A lot of straight guys find me...

508
00:19:05,612 --> 00:19:07,502
-煩人嗎 -是太有威懾力
- Annoying? - Intimidating.

509
00:19:07,502 --> 00:19:10,222
別亂接我的話 這又不是你比我猜
Wait for me to finish. This isn't Mad Libs.

510
00:19:10,472 --> 00:19:13,082
但你不相信我喜歡你嗎 胡嬌
Don't you believe that I like you, though, Pepper?

511
00:19:13,082 --> 00:19:17,381
我想相信啊 但或許我對你來說只是個累贅
I want to, but maybe I'm just a big, fat mother's purse to you.

512
00:19:19,211 --> 00:19:21,011
我是你的朋友啊 胡椒
I'm your friend, Pepper

513
00:19:21,361 --> 00:19:22,371
你干嘛啊
What are you doing?

514
00:19:22,371 --> 00:19:24,121
這可是黃西裝
This is a yellow suit!

515
00:19:24,881 --> 00:19:26,411
? 一生摯友 胡椒 ?
♪ Till the end, Pepper ♪

516
00:19:26,411 --> 00:19:27,852
別弄得像戲精發戲癮
You're making a scene!

517
00:19:28,331 --> 00:19:30,411
? 我聽過這陳腔濫調 ?
♪ I know that old line ♪

518
00:19:30,731 --> 00:19:35,570
? 但只要我信了 你就會將我拋開 ?
♪ But as soon as I sign, he'll toss me aside like ♪

519
00:19:35,570 --> 00:19:37,540
? 棄之敝履 ?
♪ Yesterday's wine ♪

520
00:19:37,540 --> 00:19:40,510
? 我的真心日月可證 ?
♪ My heart's on my sleeve ♪

521
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:43,190
? 我想相信 ?
♪ I want to believe ♪

522
00:19:43,190 --> 00:19:45,070
這也太尷尬了吧 我們是普通正常人
This is weird. We're people!

523
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:45,690
聽我說
Look.

524
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,489
你唯一能夠確定
The only way you're ever gonna find out

525
00:19:47,489 --> 00:19:49,729
我們是不是朋友的方法就是買下房子
if we're friends is if you buy that house

526
00:19:49,729 --> 00:19:51,239
然后看我會不會賺到好處就走人
and see if I stick around.

527
00:19:51,239 --> 00:19:53,569
感覺是個好昂貴的實驗啊
Seems like an expensive experiment.

528
00:19:54,649 --> 00:19:57,969
如果你真心喜歡那房子 就簽了報價單
Sign the offer... if you love the house.

529
00:19:58,089 --> 00:19:59,329
簽字或者炒我
Either that or fire me.

530
00:19:59,329 --> 00:20:00,730
你是你唯一能夠確認的辦法了
It's the only way you're gonna know.

531
00:20:07,778 --> 00:20:09,158
-我的心就交給... -有緣再會啦
- My heart is in your... - I'll see you.

532
00:20:09,158 --> 00:20:10,988
我就知道 你是無情的感情殺手
I knew it. Assassin!

533
00:20:10,988 --> 00:20:13,278
我跟你鬧著玩呢
I'm messing with you.

534
00:20:13,278 --> 00:20:15,148
我跟朋友們就喜歡鬧著玩
That's what I do with my friends.

535
00:20:15,148 --> 00:20:18,047
懂了 真有意思
Oh. I see. Delightful.

536
00:20:18,177 --> 00:20:20,167
我對直男的討喜方式還是菜鳥
I'm new at straight chummery.

537
00:20:25,237 --> 00:20:27,427
別一直看你手表了 菲爾
Stop checking your watch, Phil.

538
00:20:32,746 --> 00:20:33,807
糟糕
Oh, no!

539
00:20:34,406 --> 00:20:35,547
是大地震
It's the big one!

540
00:20:36,276 --> 00:20:37,817
我衣不蔽體
And I'm not dressed!

541
00:20:38,476 --> 00:20:40,057
拿上地震逃生包
Grab the earthquake kit!

542
00:20:40,706 --> 00:20:43,426
大家快躲到桌子底下
Everybody, get under a table!

543
00:20:45,056 --> 00:20:47,175
冰箱里有現金
There's cash in the freezer!

544
00:20:50,615 --> 00:20:53,135
老婆 這東西我們必需得投資啊
Honey, we gotta get in on this.

545
00:20:54,495 --> 00:20:56,305
我高中男友當年從我家逃跑時也用得上
My highschool boyfirend could've used that.

546
00:20:57,275 --> 00:20:58,585
都被你一句話毀了啦
You ruined it.
